msgid "<0>Kaardiga või sularahas?</0> is the café’s question, and it comes later."
msgstr "<0>Kaardiga või sularahas?</0> is the café’s question, and it comes later."

msgid "<0>Kaardiga</0> is how you pay. She asked where you’ll have it."
msgstr "<0>Kaardiga</0> is how you pay. She asked where you’ll have it."

msgid "<0>Palun</0> is what she says when she hands you things. You thank her."
msgstr "<0>Palun</0> is what she says when she hands you things. You thank her."

msgid "<0>Siin või kaasa?</0> gives two choices, so <1>jah</1> doesn’t answer it."
msgstr "<0>Siin või kaasa?</0> gives two choices, so <1>jah</1> doesn’t answer it."

msgid "<0>Siin või kaasa?</0> is the question the café asks you."
msgstr "<0>Siin või kaasa?</0> is the question the café asks you."

msgid "<0>Siin</0> answers here or to take away. She asked how you’ll pay."
msgstr "<0>Siin</0> answers here or to take away. She asked how you’ll pay."

msgid "<0>Tere</0> is hello, and you’re leaving. Say goodbye."
msgstr "<0>Tere</0> is hello, and you’re leaving. Say goodbye."

